OL,3,GNEWSAThe rippling fallout from
OL,4,APortsmouth's migrant arrivals
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the days since 120 migrants were
OL,7,Fbrought ashore in Hampshire, triggering
OL,8,Fanti-migrant protests, counter-protests
OL,9,Fand a wave of online rumours, the
OL,10,Fconsequences have rippled far beyond
OL,11,Fthose who arrived on an overcrowded
OL,12,Fboat.
OL,14,FFrom Portsmouth to Poole, communities
OL,15,Fare grappling with heightened tension,
OL,16,Ffear and mistrust, with some residents
OL,17,Favoiding certain areas as a result.
OL,19,FPeople from ethnic minority backgrounds
OL,20,Fhave expressed fears of becoming
OL,21,Ftargets of abuse or being mistaken for
OL,22,Fasylum seekers.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,334,330,200,160,0,100
